# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64065> (CGP 78608 hydrochloride)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64065> "A hydrochloride that is the monohydrochloride salt of CGP 78608. Potent and selective NMDA antagonist that acts through the glycine site (IC<small><sub>50</sub></small> = 5 nM). Displays >500-fold selectivity over kainate and AMPA receptors (IC<small><sub>50</sub></small> values are 2.7 and 3 μM respectively). Anticonvulsant in vivo following systemic administration.")
