# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64067> (SB 224289 hydrochloride)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64067> "A hydrochloride that is the monohydrochloride salt of SB 224289. Selective 5-HT<small><sub>1B</sub></small> receptor antagonist (pKi = 8.2). Displays >60-fold selectivity over 5-HT<small><sub>1D</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>1A</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>1E</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>1F</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>2A</sub></small> and 5-HT<small><sub>2C</sub></small> receptors in radioligand binding and functional assays. Centrally active following oral administration in vivo.")
