# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64069> (SB 224289)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64069> "A member of the class of benzamides obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of 2'-methyl-4'-(5-methyl-1,2,4-oxadiazol-3-yl)biphenyl-4-carboxylic acid with the secondary amino group of 1'-methyl-6,7-dihydro-5<em>H</em>-spiro[furo[2,3-<em>f</em>]indole-3,4'-piperidine]. Selective 5-HT<small><sub>1B</sub></small> receptor antagonist (pKi = 8.2). Displays >60-fold selectivity over 5-HT<small><sub>1D</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>1A</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>1E</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>1F</sub></small>, 5-HT<small><sub>2A</sub></small> and 5-HT<small><sub>2C</sub></small> receptors in radioligand binding and functional assays. Centrally active following oral administration in vivo.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "cas") <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64069> "cas:180083-23-2")
