AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64143> "A polyketide obtained from the fungus <em>Alternaria brassicicola</em> and having a highly unusual structure of an 11-carbon chain containing two epoxides and six stereogenic centres.  It is an inhibitor of histone deacetylase (HDAC) both <em>in vivo</em> and <em>in vitro</em> and also exhibits anti-angiogenic activity.")
