AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64164> "An aminoquinoline that consists of quinoline in which the hydrogen at position 2 is substituted by a 4-methylpiperazin-1-yl group. A 5-HT<small><sub>3</sub></small> agonist. Has almost the same affinity for 5-HT<small><sub>3</sub></small> sites as quipazine but unlike the latter, does not bind to 5-HT<small><sub>1B</sub></small> sites.")
