AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64165> "A hydrobromide salt obtained by reaction of clobenpropit with two equivalents of hydrobromic acid. An extremely potent histamine H<small><sub>3</sub></small> antagonist/inverse agonist (pA<small><sub>2</sub></small> = 9.93). Also displays partial agonist activity at H<small><sub>4</sub></small> receptors; induces eosinophil shape change with an EC<small><sub>50</sub></small> of 3 nM.")
