# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64191> (nafadotride)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64191> "A naphthalenecarboxamide resulting from the formal condensation of the carboxylic acid group of 4-cyano-1-methoxynaphthalene-2-carboxylic acid with the primary amino group of 1-(1-butylpyrrolidin-2-yl]methanamine. It is a highly potent, competitive, preferential dopamine D<small><sub>3</sub></small> receptor antagonist, centrally active upon systemic administration.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "cas") <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64191> "cas:149649-22-9")
