# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64207> (spiramide)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64207> "An azaspiro compound that consists of 1,3,8-triazaspiro[4.5]decan-4-one having a phenyl group attached to N-1 and a 3-(4-fluorophenoxy)propyl attached to N-8. Selective 5-HT antagonist, which binds to 5-HT<small><sub>2</sub></small> sites as potently as spiperone but has lower affinity for 5-HT<small><sub>2C</sub></small> receptors. Also a high affinity D<small><sub>2</sub></small> receptor antagonist (Ki = 3 nM). Lacks the disruptive effect of spiperone on animal behaviour.")
